# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development with `wrangler dev`.
# `.dev.vars` is git-ignored and is NEVER uploaded — production values are set
# with `wrangler secret put <NAME>`.

# Required. Create at https://resend.com/api-keys with "Sending access" only.
RESEND_API_KEY="re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"

# Optional. Only set this once you have added a Turnstile widget to the form.
# Leave unset and the Worker skips the Turnstile check entirely.
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY="0x4AAAAAAA..."
